  "_readme": "EMC x TSC1/TSC2 frequency probe, 2026-08-24. THE QUESTION: how often does extraskeletal myxoid chondrosarcoma carry an inactivating TSC1 or TSC2 alteration? Nothing in this repository had ever asked. Prompted by a single JSMO 2025 case abstract (citation id galitskiy2025emcpembrolizumab, already in research/data/emc-clinical-registry.json at its true weight: n=1, conference abstract, not peer reviewed) reporting TSC2 gene loss in an EWSR1::NR4A3 EMC. A hitCount of ZERO is the point of the Europe PMC rows, not a failure: it is the only honest basis for a bound on how much has been looked at. Every row is an API endpoint returning JSON, not an article page, because lit_fetch_urls.py's strip_html() is a no-op on JSON. The dev sandbox egress proxy 403s www.ebi.ac.uk, clinicaltrials.gov and eutils on CONNECT, so this runs on the Actions runner per CLAUDE.md 6.",
